              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What does insomnia take apart into? (In- not, somnus sleep.) And what did the tilde on ñ used to be? (A small n written above the line.)"
            }
